  "html": "<!-- wp:image {\"id\":681,\"width\":\"400px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img src=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/DJ-featured-images.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-681\" style=\"width:400px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I adore monkeys! I adore journal monkey stickers even more! Not sure why they always make me smile, but they do. So here I have combined some of my favorites, journaling, cofee, winter and monkeys. These digital stickers can be used in <a href=\"http://www.goodnotes.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Goodnotes</a> or any other notebook app that accepts pngs!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Below, you will see the Journal Monkey stickers that I currently have available. Clicking on each image will open it in a new window at full size. If you would like to bypass downloading them individually, you can sign up for  full access to the <a href=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/divergent-vault/\">Divergent Vault</a>. The vault currently hosts over 100 free printables for your journaling needs. If you want to learn more before signing up, the <a href=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/divergent-vault/\">vault page</a> lists all available resources.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Journal Monkey Stickers</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":682,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"media\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Journal-Moneys-01-divergentjournaler.png\"><img src=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Journal-Moneys-01-divergentjournaler.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-682\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":683,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"media\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Journal-Moneys-02-divergentjournaler.PNG.png\"><img src=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Journal-Moneys-02-divergentjournaler.PNG.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-683\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":684,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"media\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Journal-Moneys-03-divergentjournaler.PNG.png\"><img src=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Journal-Moneys-03-divergentjournaler.PNG.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-684\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":685,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"media\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Journal-Moneys-04-divergentjournaler.PNG.png\"><img src=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Journal-Moneys-04-divergentjournaler.PNG.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-685\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":686,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"media\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Journal-Moneys-05-divergentjournaler.PNG.png\"><img src=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Journal-Moneys-05-divergentjournaler.PNG.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-686\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":687,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"media\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Journal-Moneys-06-divergentjournaler.PNG.png\"><img src=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Journal-Moneys-06-divergentjournaler.PNG.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-687\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":688,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"media\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Journal-Moneys-07-divergentjournaler.PNG.png\"><img src=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Journal-Moneys-07-divergentjournaler.PNG.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-688\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":689,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"media\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Journal-Moneys-08-divergentjournaler.PNG.png\"><img src=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Journal-Moneys-08-divergentjournaler.PNG.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-689\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":690,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"media\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Journal-Moneys-09-divergentjournaler.PNG.png\"><img src=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Journal-Moneys-09-divergentjournaler.PNG.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-690\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":691,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"media\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Journal-Moneys-10-divergentjournaler.PNG.png\"><img src=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Journal-Moneys-10-divergentjournaler.PNG.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-691\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":692,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"media\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Journal-Moneys-11-divergentjournaler.PNG.png\"><img src=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Journal-Moneys-11-divergentjournaler.PNG.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-692\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":693,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"media\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Journal-Moneys-12-divergentjournaler.PNG.png\"><img src=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Journal-Moneys-12-divergentjournaler.PNG.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-693\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Once you download your images, you can insert them into a Word file (or Pages or any other document builder) and resize them. For your convenience, there is a PDF file containing all the stickers on one page in the vault. The printable stickers will not show the white border if printed on white paper.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you have any troubles or issues, feel free to let me know. I don't know that I can help but I am always willing to try. I hope you find these useful and enjoyable! Comment below and let me know what you think!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Happy Journaling!<br>Sarah G</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
}